                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fd5c5e8-633e-42b8-a85c-655caa8d7b0e",
                                "sense_id": "a3d13fd6-20b8-35c7-ba64-ca5beb13d5ff",
                                "text": "Толпа́ строе́ний: людски́х, амба́ров, погребо́в, ви́димо ветша́вших, — наполня́ла двор; во́зле них напра́во и нале́во видны́ бы́ли воро́та в други́е дворы́.",
                                "translation": "The yard was crowded with buildings, servants' quarters, barns and storehouses, evidently falling into decay; on the right and the left were gates leading to other yards.",
                                "english": "The yard was crowded with buildings, servants' quarters, barns and storehouses, evidently falling into decay; on the right and the left were gates leading to other yards."
